{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-hazard","title":"道德风险与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/moral-hazard","wordCount":2112,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"道德风险与激励设计\">道德风险与激励设计</h1><p>一个人买了全额车险后开车更加大胆，一个获得全额医疗保险的病人开始频繁就诊——这些现象的共同本质是：保险覆盖改变了被保险人的行为，使其承担更多风险或减少预防努力。这就是道德风险（moral hazard），保险经济学中与逆向选择并列的第二大市场失灵。不同于逆向选择的&quot;隐藏信息&quot;性质，道德风险是一个&quot;隐藏行动&quot;（hidden action）问题——发生在合同签订之后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>道德风险是保险交易<strong>之后</strong>的信息不对称，本质是&quot;隐藏行动&quot;（hidden action）：保险覆盖改变了被保险人的行为。它分为两种形态——<strong>事前道德风险</strong>削弱预防努力、抬高损失频率，<strong>事后道德风险</strong>导致过度使用或夸大损失、抬高单次赔付。因为努力不可观测，完全保险不再是帕累托最优：最优合同必须在<strong>风险分担</strong>与<strong>激励提供</strong>之间权衡，这就是&quot;保险-激励权衡&quot;。由此推出的第二最优合同要求赔付小于损失（保留部分自付），这正是免赔额与共付比例存在的经济学理由；无赔款折扣、核保条件与监控技术则从不同方向缩小信息不对称。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>应对工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事前道德风险</td>\n<td>损失前减少预防</td>\n<td>损失频率上升</td>\n<td>核保条件、NCD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事后道德风险</td>\n<td>损失后过度使用</td>\n<td>单次赔付上升</td>\n<td>免赔额、共付、上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险-激励权衡</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>最优合同非完全保险</td>\n<td>成本分担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二最优</td>\n<td>努力不可观测</td>\n<td>赔付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I&lt;d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>激励相容约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"道德风险的两种形态\">道德风险的两种形态</h2><p>精算文献将道德风险区分为两种根本不同的类型，它们的经济逻辑和应对策略截然不同：</p>\n<p><strong>事前道德风险（ex ante moral hazard）</strong>：被保险人在损失发生之前减少预防努力。安装了盗窃险的商店不再投资安保系统，有健康险的人不再坚持锻炼。机制是：全额保险消除了预防行为的经济回报——无论是否发生损失，被保险人获得相同的最终财富 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W - \\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，预防努力的边际收益降为零。</p>\n<p><strong>事后道德风险（ex post moral hazard）</strong>：损失发生之后，被保险人过度使用保险覆盖的服务或夸大损失。有医疗险的患者就诊频率上升，有车险的车主选择更贵的维修方案。机制是：当边际使用成本因保险而降至零或接近零时，需求按正常弹性上升。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>事前道德风险</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>影响损失频率（occurrence）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{事前道德风险} \\rightarrow \\text{影响损失频率（occurrence）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">事前道德风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">影响损失频率（</span><span class=\"mord\">occurrence</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>事后道德风险</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>影响损失严重度（severity）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{事后道德风险} \\rightarrow \\text{影响损失严重度（severity）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">事后道德风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">影响损失严重度（</span><span class=\"mord\">severity</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 事前道德风险&#10;        A[获得保险] --&gt; B[预防努力下降]&#10;        B --&gt; C[损失频率上升]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 事后道德风险&#10;        D[损失发生] --&gt; E[过度使用/夸大损失]&#10;        E --&gt; F[单次赔付金额上升]&#10;    end&#10;    C --&gt; G[保险公司赔付增加]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[保费上升]&#10;    H --&gt; I[福利损失]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 事前道德风险\n        A[获得保险] --&gt; B[预防努力下降]\n        B --&gt; C[损失频率上升]\n    end\n    subgraph 事后道德风险\n        D[损失发生] --&gt; E[过度使用/夸大损失]\n        E --&gt; F[单次赔付金额上升]\n    end\n    C --&gt; G[保险公司赔付增加]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[保费上升]\n    H --&gt; I[福利损失]</pre><h2 id=\"最优保险合同的激励约束\">最优保险合同的激励约束</h2><p>在道德风险存在时，完全保险不再是帕累托最优的。最优合同必须在风险分担（risk sharing）和激励提供（incentive provision）之间取得平衡——这就是保险经济学中的&quot;保险-激励权衡&quot;（insurance-incentive tradeoff）。</p>\n<p>考虑一个简化模型：被保险人选择努力水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，高努力的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，高努力使损失概率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_L &lt; p_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。保险合同规定：无损失时被保险人财富为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W - \\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，有损失时财富为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W - \\pi - d + I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 为赔付金额。</p>\n<p><strong>第一最优</strong>（可观测努力）：如果保险公司能观测到努力水平，可以写入合同&quot;选择高努力则提供全额保险&quot;，结果是完全保险 + 高预防。</p>\n<p><strong>第二最优</strong>（不可观测努力）：保险公司必须设计合同使得被保险人自愿选择高努力。激励相容约束为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(W - \\pi) - c \\geq (1 - p_L) \\cdot U(W - \\pi) + p_L \\cdot U(W - \\pi - d + I) - c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>简化后，关键约束变为：赔付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 必须小于损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（即保留部分自付），使得被保险人仍有预防激励。这就是免赔额和共付比例存在的经济学理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应对道德风险的合同工具\">应对道德风险的合同工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免赔额（deductible）</td>\n<td>小额损失完全由被保险人承担</td>\n<td>抑制小额索赔的事后道德风险</td>\n<td>对大额损失的预防激励有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共付比例（coinsurance）</td>\n<td>每次损失被保险人承担固定比例</td>\n<td>在整个损失范围内保持激励</td>\n<td>降低风险分担效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赔付上限（cap）</td>\n<td>超过上限的损失不予赔付</td>\n<td>控制极端损失的道德风险</td>\n<td>可能使被保险人面临灾难性风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无赔款折扣（NCD）</td>\n<td>未索赔年份降低来年保费</td>\n<td>跨期激励预防行为</td>\n<td>可能导致应赔不赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核保条件</td>\n<td>要求安装安全设备等</td>\n<td>直接控制可观测的预防行为</td>\n<td>仅适用于可观测行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rand-健康保险实验-道德风险的经典证据\">RAND 健康保险实验：道德风险的经典证据</h2><p>1974-1982 年的 RAND 健康保险实验是保险经济学中最重要的随机对照实验之一。研究者将参与者随机分配到不同共付比例（0%、25%、50%、95%）的健康保险计划中。</p>\n<p>核心发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 95% 共付到 0% 共付（免费医疗），医疗支出增加约 30-40%</li>\n<li>门诊利用的弹性大于住院利用的弹性</li>\n<li>关键的福利问题：增加的医疗使用中，多少是&quot;有价值的&quot;？RAND 数据表明，对于平均健康的人群，额外的使用对健康指标的改善极其有限</li>\n<li>但对低收入、高血压等脆弱人群，减少共付确实改善了健康结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些发现直接影响了后续数十年的健康保险设计——高免赔额健康计划（HDHP）在美国的流行，很大程度上建立在 RAND 实验的证据基础之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"道德风险与监控技术的演进\">道德风险与监控技术的演进</h2><p>技术进步正在改变道德风险的治理方式。传统上不可观测的行为现在越来越多地可以被实时监控：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>车载远程信息处理（telematics）</strong>：UBI（Usage-Based Insurance）通过 GPS 和加速度传感器实时记录驾驶行为——急刹车、超速、深夜驾驶等，将事前不可观测的&quot;努力水平&quot;变为可观测变量</li>\n<li><strong>可穿戴设备</strong>：健康保险公司利用智能手表数据（步数、心率、睡眠质量）来个性化定价，将预防努力直接与保费挂钩</li>\n<li><strong>IoT 传感器</strong>：商业财产险中的烟雾报警器、水浸传感器等 IoT 设备实时反馈风险状态</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从经济学角度，这些技术本质上是在缩小信息不对称——让保险公司能更接近&quot;第一最优&quot;的完全信息状态。但也引发了新的问题：隐私权与歧视性定价的边界在哪里？当保险公司能观测到一切时，&quot;保险&quot;是否还有存在的经济学意义？</p>\n<h2 id=\"道德风险的系统性影响\">道德风险的系统性影响</h2><p>道德风险不仅存在于个体保单层面，也在宏观层面产生系统性后果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>&quot;大而不能倒&quot;</strong>：金融机构预期政府救助时承担过度风险——2008 年金融危机的核心教训之一</li>\n<li><strong>存款保险的道德风险</strong>：存款保险消除了储户监督银行的激励，可能鼓励银行追求高风险投资策略</li>\n<li><strong>社会保险</strong>：失业保险降低求职努力（延长失业持续时间 1-2 周的实证发现普遍存在）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>道德风险分为事前（减少预防）和事后（过度使用）两种形态</li>\n<li>保险-激励权衡决定了最优合同不是完全保险</li>\n<li>免赔额、共付、无赔款折扣等工具各有适用场景和局限</li>\n<li>RAND 实验证实了价格弹性在医疗利用中的显著作用</li>\n<li>技术进步正在将&quot;隐藏行动&quot;转化为可观测行为，但引发新的伦理争议</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"risk-pooling-and-insurance-demand\">风险池化与保险需求</a>：道德风险如何改变保险需求的最优覆盖率</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../game-theory/game-theory-basics/dominant-strategy-and-nash-equilibrium\">纳什均衡与博弈结构</a>：道德风险问题的委托-代理博弈分析框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"道德风险与激励设计","id":"道德风险与激励设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"道德风险的两种形态","id":"道德风险的两种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"最优保险合同的激励约束","id":"最优保险合同的激励约束"},{"level":2,"text":"应对道德风险的合同工具","id":"应对道德风险的合同工具"},{"level":2,"text":"RAND 健康保险实验：道德风险的经典证据","id":"rand-健康保险实验-道德风险的经典证据"},{"level":2,"text":"道德风险与监控技术的演进","id":"道德风险与监控技术的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"道德风险的系统性影响","id":"道德风险的系统性影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"逆向选择与保险市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/adverse-selection"},"next":{"title":"精算定价基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/actuarial-pricing-fundamentals"}}